<title>POLAND: BWR Q2 net falls to PLN 0.1 mln.</title>
<headline>BWR Q2 net falls to PLN 0.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>BWR preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997     Q2 1996</p>
<p>    profit on banking operations     7.90    vs   9.87</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 0.06    vs   1.34</p>
<p>    net profit			     0.14    vs   0.90</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Bank Wspolpracy Regionalnej SA.</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues   25.03    vs  22.39</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	21.30    vs  15.91</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	   3.55    vs   2.38</p>
<p>    costs of commission		  0.42    vs   0.48</p>
<p>    income tax		    refund 0.08    vs   0.43</p>
<p>					     H1 1997     H1 1996</p>
<p>    profit on banking operations    18.53    vs  18.41</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 1.00    vs   3.30</p>
<p>    net profit			     0.69    vs   2.87</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues   51.81    vs  41.91</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	40.80    vs  30.00</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	   6.38    vs   4.80</p>
<p>    costs of commission		  0.87    vs   0.95</p>
<p>    income tax			     0.31    vs   0.43</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
